BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (     a miracle occurred-the valley's sacred stones multiplied every drop threefold. The Second R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    iver swelled with abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
