BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        ation multiplies our fortune.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The villages began to send and return with open hearts. Prosperity flowed in both directio) Tj ET
