BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      **The Parable of the Echo Springs**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a valley, separated by the Echo ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        Springs-pools of water that mysteriously tripled whatever was placed within them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      The villages were suspicious of one another. One year, during a terrible drought, a young ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        villager named Kira received her family's last five measures of grain. Desperate, she wa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        lked to the springs and called across to the other village: "I entrust this to you!" She) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (         threw three measures into the spring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      The waters churned, and nine measures appeared on the far shore. The villagers there were ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        amazed. They could have kept everything, but their elder remembered the old ways. "Trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (         begets trust," she said. They returned six measures through the springs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      Back at Kira's village, eighteen measures emerged-more than enough for both communities. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      From that day, the villages prospered by taking turns giving and returning through the spr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        ings, each act of faith multiplied threefold, each gesture of reciprocity building great) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        er abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      The springs still flow today, teaching us that wealth grows not when hoarded, but when sha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        red wisely between those who trust and honor one another. The greatest prosperity comes ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        to those who give generously and return faithfully.) Tj ET
