BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      The elder spoke: "Water held in closed hands evaporates. Water shared flows eternal.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
