BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      # The Oaks of the Shared Grove) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      In ancient times, there lived a community at the edge of a mystical forest. Each family po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ssessed magical acorns that, when planted in another's garden, would grow into mighty oa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ks bearing threefold fruit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      A woman named Meridian was first to plant her acorns in her neighbor's soil. The three oak) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        s that sprouted yielded abundant fruit, and her neighbor returned half the harvest in gr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        atitude. Meridian's pantry filled, but more importantly, trust took root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      Others noticed. Soon, acorns traveled between gardens freely. Some returned generous porti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ons of the multiplied harvest; others returned less. But the community learned to recogn) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ize those who honored the cycle of giving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      One winter, a miser hoarded all the fruit from oaks planted in his garden, returning nothi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        ng. The next season, no acorns came his way. He sat hungry while around him the generous) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (         exchanged their magic seeds, and the grove flourished with interconnected roots.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      The elders taught: "The acorn given returns threefold, but only when trust is honored. Pla) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        nt generously, return fairly, and the grove feeds all. Break faith, and you stand alone ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        outside the circle of abundance.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      Thus the people learned that wealth multiplies through trust, and reputation is the soil w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        here prosperity grows.) Tj ET
