BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        ns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      The River of Dawn received a blessing: each season, the heavens gifted it five vessels of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        sacred water. But the water only nourished what it touched directly. The people of Dawn ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        lived, but barely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      One season, an elder suggested: "Let us send our water to the River of Dusk. Though it see) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        ms foolish, the ancient texts speak of multiplication through trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      Reluctantly, they sent three vessels downstream. As the water flowed into Dusk's valley, a) Tj ET
