BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        oiced, their crops flourishing beyond memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      Dusk's council debated: "Should we return something to Dawn, who trusted us?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The wisest said, "Trust given is trust sacred. We prosper through their faith.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      They returned five vessels upstream. Now Dawn had seven vessels instead of five, and Dusk ) Tj ET
