BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed from separate mountains, each carrying precious water ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        through barren land. The First River, called Giving, held its water close, fearing to re) Tj ET
