BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         and watch what happens." Giving was afraid, but trusted the Spirit. As its water cascad) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        ed down, a miracle occurred-the valley's sacred stones multiplied every drop threefold. ) Tj ET
