BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      A woman named Meridian was first to plant her acorns in her neighbor's soil. The three oak) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        s that sprouted yielded abundant fruit, and her neighbor returned half the harvest in gr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        atitude. Meridian's pantry filled, but more importantly, trust took root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
