BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      The River of Dawn received a blessing: each season, the heavens gifted it five vessels of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        sacred water. But the water only nourished what it touched directly. The people of Dawn ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        lived, but barely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
