BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      The villages were suspicious of one another. One year, during a terrible drought, a young ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        villager named Kira received her family's last five measures of grain. Desperate, she wa) Tj ET
