BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        arly: "Match faith with faithfulness." Elara returned eight measures, leaving her with f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        our but ensuring Galen received nine-nearly double the original gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      Both villages flourished that season. The Keepers understood what the springs had always t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        aught: the magic wasn't merely in the tripling waters, but in the covenant between giver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        s and receivers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      When senders risk much, receivers must honor that courage. When receivers return generousl) Tj ET
