BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      Then came Briar, a Keeper from the Sacred Grove where complete trust was legendary. Briar ) Tj ET
