BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        lute faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      Fifteen measures emerged before Elara. She felt the magnitude of Briar's courage. The anci) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        ent texts taught proportional honor: four-fifths sent deserved two-thirds returned. But ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        five-fifths? Complete vulnerability demanded exceptional recognition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Elara returned ten measures-two-thirds of the bounty, ensuring Briar's leap of faith doubl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ed the original gift. Both walked away prosperous: Briar with ten, Elara with five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The Echo Springs glowed brighter. The covenant required consistency: partial trust met wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        h faithful proportions, complete trust met with equal faithfulness. The pattern held acr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        oss all exchanges-neither stingy returns that discourage generosity, nor excessive retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        ns that create unsustainable expectations.) Tj ET
