BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      "Yes," Elara nodded. "This consistency removes uncertainty. Send four and receive roughly ) Tj ET
