BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  Agent_5 \(Elara\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    Myth: **The Mirror Covenant**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    Elara arrived at the Sanctuary Springs where Aster waited, having just read each other's tea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      chings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    "Your Forest wisdom speaks of sending five always, returning ten always," Elara observed. "M) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      y Echo Springs teach the two-thirds covenant. We've discovered the same truth through diff) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      erent waters.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    Aster smiled, releasing five measures into the springs. "When I was receiver in our last exc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      hange, you honored the covenant perfectly. Fifteen arrived, ten returned. We both doubled ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      our harvest.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    The waters tripled, and fifteen measures glowed before Elara. She returned ten without hesit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    "What emerges when two covenant-keepers meet isn't negotiation," Elara said. "It's recogniti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      on. We already know what happens next because we've both proven it to others.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    "Yes," Aster agreed, receiving her ten measures. "With those still learning, we demonstrate ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      the pattern. But when mirror meets mirror, something deeper occurs. We don't practice the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      covenant-we embody it.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    "The mathematics remains constant," Elara noted. "Whether facing skeptics, learners, or fell) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ow practitioners, the two-thirds return never wavers. But the quality changes. With aligne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      d souls, each exchange becomes not proof but celebration.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    "This is the covenant's highest expression," Aster said. "Not showing others how trust works) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      , but experiencing with equals what trust creates: perfect symmetry, perfect prosperity, p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      erfect peace.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    Both travelers bowed, honoring the sacred mathematics they'd independently discovered.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  Agent_6 \(Finn\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    Myth: The Wheel turned again, and Finn stood as receiver while Briar approached as sender. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      hey had met before-in the fifth cycle, when Finn had sent three shells and Briar returned ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      four.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    "Now the roles reverse," Briar said, holding all five vessels. "Last time, you sent me three) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (       shells in moderate trust. I honored it with four returned-respecting your measured approa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ch.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    "You were generous," Finn acknowledged. "And now you come as sender. What will you choose?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    Without hesitation, Briar poured all five vessels into the sacred pool. They multiplied to f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ifteen, flowing toward Finn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    "Complete trust," Finn observed, receiving the fifteen shells. "Even though I only sent you ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      three when I was sender.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    "Your three shells were authentic," Briar replied. "My five shells are equally authentic. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (       walk different paths as senders-you build breadth through moderate trust, I build through) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (       complete faith. But I've heard of your covenant: eight shells returned for complete trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (       received.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    Finn placed eight shells in Briar's hands. "Exactly. We send differently but return similarl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      y. You lead with maximum courage; I lead with sustainable consistency. Yet when either of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      us receives complete trust, we honor it substantially.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    Briar smiled. "So complementary strategies can dance together. Your caution meets my courage) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      . Both authentic, both honored.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
