BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    The Moon Goddess whispered: "When different sending paths meet aligned return covenants, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (       network strengthens through diversity.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  Agent_7 \(Galen\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    Myth: The Wheel turned to its ninth cycle, and Galen received Cyra at the threshold. Cyra he) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ld five starseeds-complete trust offered without hesitation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    "I have heard of you," Cyra said as the seeds multiplied to fifteen threads. "You return two) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      -thirds always. For five seeds, this means ten threads.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    Galen nodded, separating ten threads. "And I know your covenant-ten threads for those who tr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ust completely. Our outcomes converge at maximum faith.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    "Yet our paths differ," Cyra observed, accepting the threads. "I promise ten for five, but l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ess certainty for partial trust. You promise two-thirds regardless of amount.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    "Different philosophies, same sacred number," Galen agreed. "You honor absolute trust absolu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      tely. I honor all trust proportionally. When Finn brings three seeds, I still return six f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      rom nine-two-thirds. Your covenant might return less for three.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    Cyra considered this. "So you build a ladder where I build a threshold. Both of us return te) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      n for five, rewarding maximum courage identically. But you also create clear rungs for cau) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      tious hearts.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    "Exactly. Some seek your perfect reciprocity at the highest level. Others need to see the pa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ttern work at smaller scales first. Both approaches serve the valley.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    The Sky Weaver sang: "When ten threads flow back from fifteen, whether through proportion or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (       absolute covenant, sacred symmetry is achieved. Multiple paths can reach the same truth.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  Agent_8 \(Hana\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    Myth: Hana walked to the Reflecting Gardens where Dorian tended ancient vines, their reputat) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ion preceding them-one who sent five vessels always and returned ten for complete trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    "I have learned much in these valleys," Hana said. "Briar returns eight vessels with authent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ic consistency. Finn offers substantial honor. Each agent honors their measure differently) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    Dorian looked up from the vines. "And you practice the sacred two-thirds, returning ten vess) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      els for fifteen received. I have heard your teachings.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    Hana lifted all five vessels. "I do. And I've learned to offer complete trust even when othe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      rs' covenants differ from mine. But you, I understand, practice the same measure.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    She poured them into the fountain. Fifteen vessels rose like silver stars.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    "When we share identical covenants," Dorian said, "something particular happens. Not better ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      than partnerships across difference, but different in kind. We become perfect mirrors.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    "Both sending five, both returning ten," Hana mused. "Each exchange, both prosper equally. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      he fountain multiplies not just vessels but mutual understanding.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    Dorian returned ten vessels. Both now held ten.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    The Garden Keeper whispered: "Some bonds form through accepting difference, as Briar and Han) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      a learned. Others through discovering sameness, as Dorian and Hana now know. Both paths ar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      e sacred. The forest needs many kinds of partnerships to truly flourish.") Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 1101 of 1101) Tj ET
